[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13920.71, "timestamp": "03:52:00", "text": "それ。では、あなたはこの地域を探索します。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13927.429, "timestamp": "03:52:07", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13938.15, "timestamp": "03:52:18", "text": "はい、見つけました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13944.15, "timestamp": "03:52:24", "text": "何？私たちは死んだ。黙れ。俺は兄弟だ。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13946.03, "timestamp": "03:52:26", "text": "わからない"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13963.349, "timestamp": "03:52:43", "text": "ポータルが必要だ。目を付ける必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13967.03, "timestamp": "03:52:47", "text": "その中に。それから、エンダーマンを覚えていますか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13969.59, "timestamp": "03:52:49", "text": "それは黒い物体のようなものだ。ほら、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.229, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "ポータルを開く。なんてこった？させて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13976.75, "timestamp": "03:52:56", "text": "自分"}]